Package: mmgsem
Title: Mixture Multigroup Structural Equation Modeling (MMG-SEM)
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Andres Felipe", "Perez Alonso", , "a.f.perezalonso@tilburguniversity.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2480-8771"))
Description: Package for finding clusters of groups that share similar relations between latent variables (i.e., regression parameters) through the use of MMG-SEM.
